session Voblint_Nonrelational in "." = "Voblint_Result" +
  description
    "What a non-relational domain reuses: derived arithmetic, special-call
     dispatch, executable numeric queries and executable backward filtering.
     Every theory here fixes an abstract state as one value per variable,
     which is why a relational carrier must not be able to reach it"
  sessions
    "Voblint_VIMP"
    "Voblint_Domain"
    "Voblint_Framework"
    "Voblint_Exec"
  theories
    Abstract_Arithmetic
    Special_Ops
    Numeric_Ops
    Exec_Backward
